1
00:00:01,375 --> 00:00:02,750
Arin?

2
00:00:02,750 --> 00:00:04,750
Arin, are you okay?

3
00:00:04,750 --> 00:00:08,875
[Arin]
Mom, Dad, I'm so sorry.

4
00:00:08,875 --> 00:00:12,542
I wanted to find you,
but I failed.

5
00:00:12,542 --> 00:00:14,708
I can't do anything right.

6
00:00:14,708 --> 00:00:16,875
Arin, what are
you talking about?

7
00:00:19,792 --> 00:00:22,833
[Arin] Lloyd? Nya?

8
00:00:22,833 --> 00:00:24,542
[Riyu groans]

9
00:00:24,542 --> 00:00:25,833
What happened to you?

10
00:00:25,833 --> 00:00:27,125
Ras happened.

11
00:00:27,125 --> 00:00:28,875
I saved someone named Bonzle

12
00:00:28,875 --> 00:00:30,750
from that Imperium
science girl,

13
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:33,042
but Ras showed up
out of nowhere

14
00:00:33,042 --> 00:00:35,125
and took Bonzle back.

15
00:00:35,125 --> 00:00:37,333
I did everything I could.

16
00:00:37,333 --> 00:00:40,417
Ras still plowed right
through me like I was nothing.

17
00:00:40,417 --> 00:00:42,125
Do you know where Ras is now?

18
00:00:42,125 --> 00:00:45,792
Strike the Gong of Shattering,
prepare the ritual.

19
00:00:46,958 --> 00:00:48,833
Looks like the boss
cleaned up your mistake.

20
00:00:48,833 --> 00:00:50,583
[Jordana groans]

21
00:00:50,583 --> 00:00:53,542
[Kai] Shh, it's Kai.
I'm gonna melt your shackle.

22
00:00:54,833 --> 00:00:57,667
[suspenseful music]

23
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,125
[gong echoes]

24
00:01:03,250 --> 00:01:06,292
[Kai groans]

25
00:01:06,292 --> 00:01:09,042
[gong echoes]

26
00:01:09,042 --> 00:01:10,333
<i>♪ Lost in the unknown ♪</i>

27
00:01:10,333 --> 00:01:12,125
<i>♪ So much to see ♪</i>

28
00:01:12,125 --> 00:01:14,500
<i>♪ Together we will rise ♪</i>

29
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:17,458
<i>♪ We fight ♪</i>

30
00:01:17,458 --> 00:01:21,542
<i>♪ Be a Ninja</i>
<i>for what's right ♪</i>

31
00:01:22,583 --> 00:01:24,083
[flames roar]

32
00:01:24,083 --> 00:01:28,500
-[gong echoes]
-[choir vocalizes]

33
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:30,333
[Sorceress grunts]

34
00:01:30,333 --> 00:01:35,042
Ow. Now I remember
why I never ride you, Hatty.

35
00:01:35,042 --> 00:01:37,083
[grunts] Come on!

36
00:01:37,083 --> 00:01:39,667
We gotta get Bonzle back
from Ras and the Wolf...

37
00:01:41,458 --> 00:01:42,917
Where are Ras and his army?

38
00:01:42,917 --> 00:01:44,167
And have you seen our friend?

39
00:01:44,167 --> 00:01:45,917
She's about this tall.

40
00:01:45,917 --> 00:01:47,667
Also, a skeleton.

41
00:01:47,667 --> 00:01:51,167
Haven't seen her! And Ras
set our island to crash!

42
00:01:51,167 --> 00:01:54,667
[suspenseful music]

43
00:01:54,667 --> 00:01:57,125
[chains clink]

44
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:09,500
What! No thank you for
the all-powerful Gandeleria?

45
00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:12,167
There's gotta be a way to stop
this thing from crashing!

46
00:02:12,167 --> 00:02:13,250
Is there a motor room?

47
00:02:14,875 --> 00:02:17,083
[gear creaks]

48
00:02:17,083 --> 00:02:18,792
It would seem
repairs are in order.

49
00:02:20,375 --> 00:02:22,958
Good thing I brought my tools.

50
00:02:22,958 --> 00:02:25,500
[heroic music]

51
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:37,583
[Cole grunts]

52
00:02:38,583 --> 00:02:41,083
[gong echoes]

53
00:02:42,125 --> 00:02:45,083
[Ninjas groan]

54
00:02:49,833 --> 00:02:51,542
The secret
enchantments, Lord Ras.

55
00:02:51,542 --> 00:02:53,875
Your pronunciation must be--

56
00:02:53,875 --> 00:02:55,500
Do not worry about my part.

57
00:02:55,500 --> 00:02:57,375
It will be perfect.

58
00:02:57,375 --> 00:03:01,458
Are you prepared to revert
this spell and summon the Five?

59
00:03:01,458 --> 00:03:03,250
[sighs]

60
00:03:03,250 --> 00:03:07,042
Yes, I will be able to
completely control this spell.

61
00:03:07,042 --> 00:03:10,583
[Bonzle] I'm not just
a spell! I'm a person!

62
00:03:10,583 --> 00:03:13,500
Quiet!
No more mistakes.

63
00:03:13,500 --> 00:03:15,833
<i>Theo'do'nox cataline no dox ret</i>

64
00:03:15,833 --> 00:03:20,417
<i>so ana-ton go so-lox</i>
<i>anitatatay-poxel.</i>

65
00:03:20,417 --> 00:03:24,000
<i>No'verix catalo</i>
<i>ana-ton re-ingalago</i>

66
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:26,042
<i>so-lox niver-maste</i>
<i>fo le pezotan...</i>

67
00:03:26,042 --> 00:03:29,708
[Wyldfyre groans]

68
00:03:31,208 --> 00:03:33,208
These masks are the worst!

69
00:03:33,208 --> 00:03:35,375
Hold still, my aim is perfect!

70
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:41,000
[Kai] Wait, are you sure you--
[yells]

71
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,917
Nice. [sniffs]

72
00:03:42,917 --> 00:03:45,750
Wait, does anyone
smell burnt hair?

73
00:03:45,750 --> 00:03:47,708
-[flame roars]
-[Cinder] Intruders!

74
00:03:47,708 --> 00:03:49,917
-[gasps]
-[Kai grunts]

75
00:03:49,917 --> 00:03:52,083
Stop the Ninja from
freeing the prisoners!

76
00:03:52,083 --> 00:03:55,167
We need sacrifices!
[continues chanting]

77
00:03:55,167 --> 00:03:57,417
Ready for some
Rising Dragon Technique, Kai?

78
00:03:59,500 --> 00:04:01,375
Uh, anytime now.

79
00:04:01,375 --> 00:04:03,208
I'm connecting
my internal movement

80
00:04:03,208 --> 00:04:05,042
to the movement
of the universe,

81
00:04:05,042 --> 00:04:06,250
like we were taught.

82
00:04:06,250 --> 00:04:09,042
No, you're standing still.

83
00:04:09,042 --> 00:04:13,458
Okay, look, I only did
Rising Dragon once, by accident.

84
00:04:13,458 --> 00:04:15,750
I'm not sure I can do it again.

85
00:04:15,750 --> 00:04:18,167
New plan.
You fight the Wolf Masks,

86
00:04:18,167 --> 00:04:20,333
and I keep Cinder
from Shatterspinning.

87
00:04:20,333 --> 00:04:22,250
Now, that I can do!

88
00:04:22,250 --> 00:04:25,042
[dramatic music]

89
00:04:32,417 --> 00:04:34,542
[clanking and crashing]

90
00:04:35,958 --> 00:04:39,000
[Wyldfyre grunts]

91
00:04:51,958 --> 00:04:54,500
[Cinder growls]

92
00:04:54,500 --> 00:04:57,292
[Cinder grunts]

93
00:05:02,458 --> 00:05:04,208
[Cinder groans]

94
00:05:04,208 --> 00:05:06,458
You think I didn't
expect your smoke form?

95
00:05:06,458 --> 00:05:08,667
[Cinder grunts]

96
00:05:10,125 --> 00:05:11,333
[Bonzle] No! Please!

97
00:05:13,792 --> 00:05:15,958
[suspenseful music]

98
00:05:17,458 --> 00:05:19,208
-[chains clink]
-There you go!

99
00:05:19,208 --> 00:05:21,875
You can thank Wyldfyre
for your freedom.

100
00:05:21,875 --> 00:05:23,375
[flames roar]

101
00:05:23,375 --> 00:05:25,875
[Kai] Don't these
clowns feel any pain?

102
00:05:26,958 --> 00:05:29,958
[Kai grunts]

103
00:05:36,167 --> 00:05:38,417
[flames roar]

104
00:05:38,417 --> 00:05:40,375
[heroic music]

105
00:05:40,375 --> 00:05:42,750
Kai! Need a hand?

106
00:05:46,792 --> 00:05:49,208
[shackles clank]

107
00:05:49,208 --> 00:05:50,917
Ready to join the fight!

108
00:05:50,917 --> 00:05:53,792
No! You're all some kinda
sacrifices or something.

109
00:05:53,792 --> 00:05:57,000
Ras can't finish his plan
without you, so get outta here!

110
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:59,583
<i>Leber-lox menoo-gala</i>
<i>het regalo.</i>

111
00:05:59,583 --> 00:06:02,292
<i>Poxel da in-therox lef belent</i>

112
00:06:02,292 --> 00:06:05,083
<i>mil-troton sempaste</i>
<i>guthero-vix to!</i>

113
00:06:05,083 --> 00:06:06,917
No!

114
00:06:06,917 --> 00:06:10,167
[suspenseful music]

115
00:06:14,542 --> 00:06:16,792
[gateway roars]

116
00:06:21,583 --> 00:06:25,042
Oh, no!
The gateway is open!

117
00:06:32,917 --> 00:06:36,125
Bring the sacrifices!

118
00:06:36,125 --> 00:06:39,417
What? Don't let them escape!

119
00:06:44,625 --> 00:06:46,167
[Wyldfyre]
No monks for you!

120
00:06:46,167 --> 00:06:48,625
[Cinder grunts]

121
00:06:48,625 --> 00:06:49,875
[Sora groans]

122
00:06:49,875 --> 00:06:51,500
[yells]

123
00:06:55,125 --> 00:06:56,542
[mech beeps]

124
00:06:56,542 --> 00:06:58,958
[Kai yells]

125
00:06:58,958 --> 00:07:00,792
[Kai grunts]

126
00:07:00,792 --> 00:07:02,500
Eat fire!

127
00:07:03,708 --> 00:07:06,292
[Wyldfyre grunts]

128
00:07:06,292 --> 00:07:09,792
Come on, do you really
want Cinder back?

129
00:07:09,792 --> 00:07:12,375
This guy is a grade-A jerk!

130
00:07:12,375 --> 00:07:14,625
[Cinder grunts]

131
00:07:14,625 --> 00:07:17,375
If we're going down, Kai,
we're going down together,

132
00:07:17,375 --> 00:07:21,083
like the fire-breathing
dragons we are!

133
00:07:21,083 --> 00:07:23,250
[Lloyd] Ninja, go!

134
00:07:26,625 --> 00:07:28,500
-[Nya] You okay?
-Of course.

135
00:07:28,500 --> 00:07:31,458
Kai and I had this
totally under control.

136
00:07:31,458 --> 00:07:33,833
[Kai groans]

137
00:07:33,833 --> 00:07:36,875
Arin! I was afraid
you went down with the Bounty!

138
00:07:36,875 --> 00:07:38,125
[Arin] Riyu flew us to safety.

139
00:07:38,125 --> 00:07:40,083
What? He can't fly.

140
00:07:40,083 --> 00:07:41,542
We trained and-- Oop!

141
00:07:43,042 --> 00:07:46,125
I stand corrected.

142
00:07:46,125 --> 00:07:50,833
<i>Baka-lu. Poxel da</i>
<i>in-therox lef belent</i>

143
00:07:50,833 --> 00:07:54,417
<i>mil-troton sempaste</i>
<i>guthero-vix to.</i>

144
00:07:54,417 --> 00:07:57,167
Cinder! Finish this!

145
00:07:59,208 --> 00:08:01,083
[Cinder grunts]

146
00:08:03,958 --> 00:08:05,875
[groans]
Oh no!

147
00:08:05,875 --> 00:08:07,167
[Sora yells]

148
00:08:07,167 --> 00:08:08,375
[Sora groans]

149
00:08:08,375 --> 00:08:11,292
[Arin] Sora, get up!

150
00:08:11,292 --> 00:08:14,458
She's unconscious?
Aw, too bad.

151
00:08:14,458 --> 00:08:16,875
She'll miss my
sweet Shatterspin.

152
00:08:20,625 --> 00:08:22,542
[Cinder growls]

153
00:08:22,542 --> 00:08:24,833
[Arin] Ninja! Don't
let Cinder get that mask!

154
00:08:26,167 --> 00:08:27,500
[Cinder groans]

155
00:08:32,542 --> 00:08:35,208
[flames roar]

156
00:08:35,208 --> 00:08:36,958
[chuckles]

157
00:08:36,958 --> 00:08:39,333
Fine, that's
not the only mask!

158
00:08:45,375 --> 00:08:49,667
I will shatter the last
dregs of goodness in my soul!

159
00:08:49,667 --> 00:08:51,250
[Cinder laughs]

160
00:08:51,250 --> 00:08:52,917
[gong echoes]

161
00:08:55,625 --> 00:08:57,333
[Cinder grunts]

162
00:09:00,833 --> 00:09:03,667
-We have to stop this!
-[Nya] We can't.

163
00:09:12,708 --> 00:09:15,667
-[Wyldfyre groans]
-[Riyu roars]

164
00:09:15,667 --> 00:09:17,000
[Riyu grunts]

165
00:09:19,667 --> 00:09:22,458
[Nya grunts]

166
00:09:26,042 --> 00:09:28,458
-What is that?
-It's Kai!

167
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:33,667
[Cinder grunts]

168
00:09:33,667 --> 00:09:36,375
[heroic music]

169
00:09:39,750 --> 00:09:42,958
Rising Dragon Technique?
Impossible!

170
00:09:44,958 --> 00:09:47,583
[Ras grunts]

171
00:09:47,583 --> 00:09:48,917
[Kai] Nice trick, right?

172
00:09:48,917 --> 00:09:50,208
Wanna see more?

173
00:09:59,583 --> 00:10:01,792
[Ras growls]

174
00:10:10,500 --> 00:10:11,958
You are too late!

175
00:10:11,958 --> 00:10:15,125
The ritual is nearly complete!

176
00:10:15,125 --> 00:10:16,750
[Ras groans]

177
00:10:16,750 --> 00:10:18,458
[Lloyd] Your Shatterspin
warrior's met his match,

178
00:10:18,458 --> 00:10:20,292
and the Blood Moon's
almost passed.

179
00:10:20,292 --> 00:10:22,500
Even your sacrifices are gone!

180
00:10:22,500 --> 00:10:26,583
Yeah, I'd say the ritual's
almost over, and you failed!

181
00:10:26,583 --> 00:10:30,792
All I need for a sacrifice
is an un-shattered soul.

182
00:10:30,792 --> 00:10:33,042
And I know just who to use.

183
00:10:39,667 --> 00:10:42,667
[Kai yells]

184
00:10:42,667 --> 00:10:44,458
[grunting, groaning]

185
00:10:46,167 --> 00:10:47,750
[Nya] Kai!

186
00:10:48,958 --> 00:10:50,167
[Riyu grunts]

187
00:10:50,167 --> 00:10:52,792
[Kai] No!

188
00:10:55,792 --> 00:10:57,125
[Nya] No!

189
00:11:16,833 --> 00:11:18,208
Huh?

190
00:11:18,208 --> 00:11:20,042
Finally,

191
00:11:20,042 --> 00:11:22,958
after long centuries...

192
00:11:22,958 --> 00:11:24,500
I'm free.

193
00:11:27,583 --> 00:11:30,167
[suspenseful music]

194
00:11:30,167 --> 00:11:32,917
Hold on! I'll get you a rope!

195
00:11:40,250 --> 00:11:41,833
Close enough.

196
00:11:41,833 --> 00:11:43,625
[Cole grunts]

197
00:11:43,625 --> 00:11:45,583
It won't budge.

198
00:11:45,583 --> 00:11:47,833
[metal creaks]

199
00:11:51,250 --> 00:11:52,625
[grunts, groans]

200
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,917
It might not have to.

201
00:11:55,917 --> 00:11:57,375
If you could hold
the bottom of the wheel

202
00:11:57,375 --> 00:11:59,542
and reach the top mechanism,

203
00:11:59,542 --> 00:12:01,958
your mech could effectively
act as a new wheel assembly

204
00:12:01,958 --> 00:12:03,375
and right the kingdom.

205
00:12:07,167 --> 00:12:08,875
[Cole groans]

206
00:12:08,875 --> 00:12:10,458
[Cole]
My mech is too small.

207
00:12:10,458 --> 00:12:12,542
I can't reach
the ceiling mechanism!

208
00:12:12,542 --> 00:12:15,875
If there was only a method
of increasing your mech's size.

209
00:12:17,333 --> 00:12:19,583
[gasps] Hold that thought!

210
00:12:19,583 --> 00:12:21,375
But I'm not a mechanic!

211
00:12:21,375 --> 00:12:23,750
What could you
possibly need me for?

212
00:12:23,750 --> 00:12:25,625
As much as I hate to say it,

213
00:12:25,625 --> 00:12:28,500
we need you to use your
size-changing spell on me.

214
00:12:40,917 --> 00:12:42,333
[grunting]

215
00:12:45,875 --> 00:12:48,333
Come on, Zane!
You got this!

216
00:12:53,583 --> 00:12:55,292
[suspenseful music]

217
00:12:57,292 --> 00:12:58,875
Oh, this is bad!

218
00:13:08,875 --> 00:13:12,083
It seems
to have gotten easier,

219
00:13:12,083 --> 00:13:14,250
like someone is helping me!

220
00:13:14,250 --> 00:13:15,625
It's working!

221
00:13:15,625 --> 00:13:17,250
You've almost
straightened it out!

222
00:13:17,250 --> 00:13:19,042
[grunts]

223
00:13:19,042 --> 00:13:20,750
Oh, no.

224
00:13:20,750 --> 00:13:24,250
I did not factor in
this part of the spell.

225
00:13:24,250 --> 00:13:26,042
Hold on!
We are going to crash!

226
00:13:29,375 --> 00:13:31,375
[groans]

227
00:13:32,875 --> 00:13:36,167
[heroic music]

228
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:39,417
[sighs]

229
00:13:41,083 --> 00:13:42,500
[sighs]

230
00:13:46,250 --> 00:13:47,917
[gasps] Oh, my.

231
00:13:51,500 --> 00:13:53,292
We didn't fall?

232
00:13:56,000 --> 00:14:00,167
-Zane, we did it!
-Did we?

233
00:14:00,167 --> 00:14:03,083
[grunts]
Something's happening.

234
00:14:03,083 --> 00:14:05,458
Losing control!

235
00:14:05,458 --> 00:14:08,625
I am the one responsible
for your release.

236
00:14:08,625 --> 00:14:11,250
And I intend
to free the others,

237
00:14:11,250 --> 00:14:13,833
using them as sacrifices!

238
00:14:13,833 --> 00:14:15,833
Whatever it takes.

239
00:14:19,875 --> 00:14:21,917
[Ninjas yell]

240
00:14:27,667 --> 00:14:29,625
[Nya] This is for Kai!

241
00:14:29,625 --> 00:14:31,000
[whooshing]

242
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:32,667
[Nya yells, grunts]

243
00:14:36,542 --> 00:14:39,458
-[groans]
-[all exclaim]

244
00:14:39,458 --> 00:14:41,375
[Lloyd grunts]
No, no, no, no, no, no, no.

245
00:14:41,375 --> 00:14:43,542
Not now, please.

246
00:14:47,083 --> 00:14:48,750
[groans, pants]

247
00:14:48,750 --> 00:14:51,000
Rontu told me
I can't force the universe

248
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:52,875
to bend to my will.

249
00:14:52,875 --> 00:14:55,458
I have to find
my place in its current,

250
00:14:55,458 --> 00:14:58,875
allow the visions
to come, to flow.

251
00:15:00,042 --> 00:15:02,417
[dramatic music]

252
00:15:07,417 --> 00:15:10,125
[Lloyd grunts]

253
00:15:13,958 --> 00:15:16,417
Oh, come on!

254
00:15:17,667 --> 00:15:20,167
Aah! This can't be possible!

255
00:15:20,167 --> 00:15:21,792
The spell's fighting me!

256
00:15:21,792 --> 00:15:24,292
It's trying to shut the gate!

257
00:15:24,292 --> 00:15:26,625
Keep that gate open!

258
00:15:26,625 --> 00:15:28,833
[Bonzle]
<i>Red Ninja, wake up!</i>

259
00:15:28,833 --> 00:15:31,250
[Kai grunts]
Wha--

260
00:15:31,250 --> 00:15:33,625
Who is that? Where am I?

261
00:15:33,625 --> 00:15:35,417
[Bonzle] <i>I'm the spell</i>
<i>Ras is using</i>

262
00:15:35,417 --> 00:15:37,417
<i>to keep the gateway open.</i>

263
00:15:37,417 --> 00:15:39,500
<i>The Ninja are fighting so hard.</i>

264
00:15:39,500 --> 00:15:42,250
<i>I think I can help them</i>
<i>and can shut the gate down</i>

265
00:15:42,250 --> 00:15:44,750
<i>before the rest of the</i>
<i>Forbidden Five come through.</i>

266
00:15:44,750 --> 00:15:46,542
What do you need me to do?

267
00:15:46,542 --> 00:15:47,792
[Bonzle] <i>You've gotta get</i>
<i>back to the other side</i>

268
00:15:47,792 --> 00:15:49,417
<i>before I shut the gate,</i>

269
00:15:49,417 --> 00:15:51,625
<i>or you'll be trapped</i>
<i>in here forever.</i>

270
00:15:51,625 --> 00:15:53,583
I don't know how to do that.

271
00:15:53,583 --> 00:15:55,375
I'll try to find a way out,

272
00:15:55,375 --> 00:15:57,625
but if you get a chance
to close that gate, close it.

273
00:15:57,625 --> 00:15:58,792
Don't worry about me!

274
00:16:06,333 --> 00:16:10,375
[Nya grunts]

275
00:16:10,375 --> 00:16:13,000
I'll knock the sacrifices
in there myself!

276
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:15,542
[grunts]

277
00:16:15,542 --> 00:16:18,250
[Arin] No, not Nya too!

278
00:16:20,667 --> 00:16:22,250
Huh?

279
00:16:22,250 --> 00:16:24,042
[Arin] Come on,
object-Spinjitzu.

280
00:16:24,042 --> 00:16:26,125
You gotta work this time!
[grunts]

281
00:16:27,542 --> 00:16:29,042
[grunting]

282
00:16:36,417 --> 00:16:40,917
[gasps]
I did it! I did it!

283
00:16:40,917 --> 00:16:42,583
[Arin cheers]

284
00:16:42,583 --> 00:16:44,042
That wasn't Arin.

285
00:16:44,042 --> 00:16:46,708
-You used your tech powers to--
-Shh.

286
00:16:47,875 --> 00:16:49,875
[Jordana grunts]

287
00:16:54,583 --> 00:16:56,042
[gasps]

288
00:16:56,042 --> 00:16:59,000
[Nya] No!
Kai is still in there!

289
00:17:05,042 --> 00:17:09,792
Master!
I call for your aid!

290
00:17:16,583 --> 00:17:18,042
[Lloyd] Huh?

291
00:17:23,125 --> 00:17:24,208
[all gasp]

292
00:17:28,625 --> 00:17:30,833
[Arin] So did we win?

293
00:17:30,833 --> 00:17:32,750
[gentle music]

294
00:17:38,333 --> 00:17:40,458
[stone cracks]

295
00:17:53,667 --> 00:17:56,000
The Blood Moon has passed.

296
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:57,833
Our curse is over.

297
00:17:57,833 --> 00:18:01,083
The world is still here.

298
00:18:01,083 --> 00:18:03,750
Maybe the Ninja didn't mess up.

299
00:18:06,500 --> 00:18:08,917
[grunts]
What?

300
00:18:08,917 --> 00:18:11,792
How did--
Where are we?

301
00:18:13,042 --> 00:18:15,167
How dare you?

302
00:18:15,167 --> 00:18:18,000
You cut and run before
you got the other four out!

303
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:21,917
[grunts] You will not
speak to me like that, Nokt.

304
00:18:21,917 --> 00:18:24,750
You owe your freedom to me.

305
00:18:24,750 --> 00:18:26,250
[grunts]

306
00:18:31,417 --> 00:18:32,667
[Nokt screams]

307
00:18:32,667 --> 00:18:35,417
I expect loyalty.

308
00:18:35,417 --> 00:18:39,292
And my control device
will guarantee I get it.

309
00:18:40,375 --> 00:18:41,917
And you!

310
00:18:41,917 --> 00:18:45,792
You failed to keep
the portal open, Jordana!

311
00:18:45,792 --> 00:18:48,500
-[grunting]
-[Nokt groans]

312
00:18:48,500 --> 00:18:51,708
Do you hear me, Jord--
[yells]

313
00:18:51,708 --> 00:18:54,333
[celestial whirring]

314
00:18:55,542 --> 00:18:58,625
Yes, my master.
I understand.

315
00:18:58,625 --> 00:19:01,292
This was just one
step in the plan,

316
00:19:01,292 --> 00:19:02,750
but far from the only one.

317
00:19:02,750 --> 00:19:04,250
[celestial whirring]

318
00:19:05,375 --> 00:19:07,167
I will not fail you.

319
00:19:07,167 --> 00:19:10,292
We will still conquer
the Tournament of the Sources

320
00:19:10,292 --> 00:19:12,708
and dominate the Source Dragons.

321
00:19:12,708 --> 00:19:17,167
Then all the power
you need will be yours.

322
00:19:20,208 --> 00:19:21,750
[Cole gasps]

323
00:19:26,625 --> 00:19:28,667
Nothing in the archive explains

324
00:19:28,667 --> 00:19:31,583
what you saw happen
at the Shadow Dojo

325
00:19:31,583 --> 00:19:33,500
or where it might have gone.

326
00:19:33,500 --> 00:19:37,625
But this much I do know, we
cannot thank you enough, Ninja.

327
00:19:37,625 --> 00:19:39,792
You have much to celebrate.

328
00:19:39,792 --> 00:19:42,625
Why don't I feel
like celebrating?

329
00:19:42,625 --> 00:19:45,417
I would never have admitted
it when I was a kid,

330
00:19:45,417 --> 00:19:49,000
but my big brother
was always my hero.

331
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:51,542
Now he's the world's hero.

332
00:19:51,542 --> 00:19:52,917
[sighs] Again.

333
00:19:54,875 --> 00:19:56,667
[both sob]

334
00:19:56,667 --> 00:19:59,125
[Zane]
Bonzle is gone too.

335
00:19:59,125 --> 00:20:02,750
It appears she used the last
of her magic to battle Jordana

336
00:20:02,750 --> 00:20:04,542
and close the gate.

337
00:20:04,542 --> 00:20:06,625
I'm so proud of her.

338
00:20:06,625 --> 00:20:09,292
She was a such
a selfless little spell.

339
00:20:09,292 --> 00:20:12,292
No, she was a selfless person.

340
00:20:20,792 --> 00:20:22,375
Great job, Arin.

341
00:20:22,375 --> 00:20:24,125
Knocking out Ras with
your object spinjitzu

342
00:20:24,125 --> 00:20:26,333
is what brought
the ritual to an end.

343
00:20:26,333 --> 00:20:28,333
We couldn't have
done it without you.

344
00:20:28,333 --> 00:20:31,250
I gotta admit, after
my mess-up training,

345
00:20:31,250 --> 00:20:34,625
I started to wonder if I even
belonged on the team anymore.

346
00:20:35,458 --> 00:20:38,417
But pulling out a win today
really meant a lot to me.

347
00:20:45,625 --> 00:20:48,083
[eerie music]

348
00:20:53,917 --> 00:20:57,583
[Bonzle]
Hey. It's okay. It's me.

349
00:20:57,583 --> 00:20:59,708
[gasps] That voice.

350
00:21:01,625 --> 00:21:04,458
You're the spell?
The voice I heard?

351
00:21:05,750 --> 00:21:08,000
I closed the gate.

352
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:10,833
Most of the Forbidden Five
couldn't cross over.

353
00:21:10,833 --> 00:21:14,125
But now we're both trapped here.

354
00:21:14,125 --> 00:21:15,750
I'm so sorry.

355
00:21:15,750 --> 00:21:17,542
No apology needed.

356
00:21:17,542 --> 00:21:19,042
You did good, kid.

357
00:21:19,042 --> 00:21:20,958
I didn't even know
if I'd survive.

358
00:21:20,958 --> 00:21:22,792
But we did!

359
00:21:22,792 --> 00:21:25,625
Now we've got one job,
to find a way out.

360
00:21:25,625 --> 00:21:27,125
I hate to tell you,

361
00:21:27,125 --> 00:21:29,125
but unless there's
another Blood Moon,

362
00:21:29,125 --> 00:21:30,917
there's no way
to escape this place.

363
00:21:30,917 --> 00:21:32,625
And there won't be
another Blood Moon

364
00:21:32,625 --> 00:21:35,167
for, like, a zillion years.

365
00:21:35,167 --> 00:21:37,333
It's useless
to even try to escape.

366
00:21:37,333 --> 00:21:40,292
Well, like my friend
Lloyd always says,

367
00:21:40,292 --> 00:21:42,500
"Ninja never quit."

368
00:21:42,500 --> 00:21:45,042
[heroic music]

369
00:21:45,042 --> 00:21:47,000
[closing theme music]

